  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat broiler.",
    "2. Slice the andouille sausage into 1-inch thick patties.",
    "3. Place the patties on the broil pan, leaving about 1 inch of space between each patty.",
    "4. Brush the broil pan with olive oil to prevent sticking.",
    "5. Broil the sausage patties for 4-5 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "6. Meanwhile, toast the hamburger buns on the broil pan.",
    "7. Assemble the burgers by spreading mayonnaise or ketchup on the bottom bun, followed by a cooked sausage patty, cheese slice, lettuce, tomato slice, and onion slice.",
    "8. Top with the top bun.",
    "9. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
